This is a OpenCL wrapper for grab the API call from OpenCL


------------------------------------
Compile:

 There are two arguments that can be defined that will be 
 used into the compile processes
OPENCL_LIBRARY
OPENCL_INCLUDE 


example:
OPENCL_LIBRARY=/usr/lib OPENCL_INCLUDE=/home/lucas/NVIDIA_GPU_Computing_SDK/OpenCL/common/inc/ make

Compiling options:
debug; 
release;           # default 
------------------------------------
Usage:

LD_PRELOAD=libocl_profiler.so clinfo  
------------------------------------